From: ACK72 <acikom72@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 22:32:48 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] airoha: reduce guarded L2, mailbox and initialization overhead

Resolve ingress metadata only for L2 fallback; retain the collision
window and checked flow removal. Omit unused WLAN SET reply copies. Sleep
between sleepable initialization retries while retaining the minimum wait
and retry limit. Avoid redundant TRTCM DONE polling and unused high-word
reads after checked readback; propagate read errors and exhausted mismatch
retries. Atomic PPE mailbox locking and timeout behavior are unchanged.

diff --git a/target/linux/airoha/patches-6.18/9999-zzzzzzzz-0032-airoha-reduce-guarded-control-path-overhead.patch b/target/linux/airoha/patches-6.18/9999-zzzzzzzz-0032-airoha-reduce-guarded-control-path-overhead.patch
